WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,840 --> 00:00:01,960
your name age

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,240
Zhou Tie, uncle

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,680
You are an extraordinary child

4
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,880
You are the crane in the sky

5
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,400
Demoted to Fanjian for making mistakes

6
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,680
You died somewhere, right?

7
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,920
Why did I see an old lady?

8
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:10,920
Hanging around you

9
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:11,880
She wants to be a humble king

10
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:12,920
You have to establish a hall first

11
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,200
Otherwise it would be unfilial

12
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:16,920
Daxian, are you sure that’s my breast?

13
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,160
How many years has she been gone?

14
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,300
Then how did they get involved with me?

15
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,120
Could it be Mr. Mohetou?

16
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,720
Still treating me like a chess piece

17
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,200
If you don't believe it

18
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,640
That means we have no fate

19
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:30,480
I won’t see you off if I walk slowly

20
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:33,010
She is deceiving us

21
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:34,690
I think we dare not leave

22
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,320
She is so angry

23
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:37,680
It has nothing to do with whether a church is established or not.

24
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,560
She discovered that the old immortal who was begging at the entrance of the hall was rescued by me.

25
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,420
The begging old immortal

26
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,060
The one from Qian Yehong’s family

27
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,980
Go home and replace that person and ask

28
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:51,610
She knows your real name

29
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:53,130
I'll probably come back tonight to cause trouble.
